		(uuid "d6f3ee4d-2716-41d9-b6d6-9c6dae0c5766")) 
	(text "U4/U7 transfer: VOUT = 2*VDAC - VREF (nominal).\nCode 0 = -VREF; 32768 = 0; 65535 approx +VREF.\nFirmware code polarity is reversed.\nPower-up code 0 gives nonzero output.\nKeep output inhibited until rails are valid\nand midscale is loaded. Hardware mute is unresolved.\nVREF follows RAW: 3.135 to 3.465 V in steady state." 
		(at 419.1 309.88 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "1dd510ee-8161-4c65-b249-3718a550ca61")) 
	(text "R3 = R6 and R11 = R12 = 20k nominal.\nSource 1% parts retained; validate ratio accuracy.\nAdded 22uF bulk needs >=10uF effective at bias.\nAdded 10nF: 50 V, 0402; place at VDD/VISOOUT.\nNew capacitor MPNs remain TBD; draft specs only." 
		(at 419.1 350.52 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "45b1c170-d2ae-438b-a872-ab96c80f788a")) 
	(text "Channels retain separate isolated grounds. J1/J2 pin 7 reports ISOW EN/FLT through a 10k pull-up; MCU input must not fight an asserted fault." 
		(at 25.4 340.36 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.524 1.524)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "2ec4feea-abb6-4b2c-8726-3c12007ad761")) 
	(text "J3/J4: 1 = bipolar signal, 2 = direct regulated RAW via 0-ohm link (legacy CLEAN name), 3 = isolated ground." 
